     "titulo": "Key idea",
     "texto": [
      "Some 받침 are written with two consonants, although in final position usually only one is heard. In 읽다 the sound is ㄱ; before a vowel, in 읽어요, ㄱ links to 어 and ㄹ stays as the final consonant.",
